[DANNY]
You put the- The old man holds up one hand.
ເຈົ້າເອົາ - ພໍ່ເຖົ້າຖືມືຫນຶ່ງຂຶ້ນ.

73
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,600
[PRINCIPAL]
In ivrit.
ໃນ ivrit.

